      "seed": 1538499524,
      "version": 1079,
      "versionNonce": 1460994116,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776946619806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Operating System Responsibilities:\n\n                1. Process Management     (Multitasking & Multicore Parallel Process)\n                2. Memory Management    (RAM)\n                        - Allocate the Memory & Deallocate Memory for Programs\n                        - Memory Protection\n                        - Shared Memory\n                        - Memory Attributes\n                3. Storage Management     (ROM) \n                     - Fragmentation\n                     - Alogo (ext4, fatfs, NTFS, jffs2, ISO9660)\n                     - metadata (Data struct about files location to access)\n                     - Storing & Organizing data\n                4. IO Management\n                     - Resond with IO Events which generated by IO devices\n                     - Interfaces with pheripherals\n                5. Network Management\n                     Manage network packets\n                     Network Interface cards",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Operating System Responsibilities:\n\n                1. Process Management     (Multitasking & Multicore Parallel Process)\n                2. Memory Management    (RAM)\n                        - Allocate the Memory & Deallocate Memory for Programs\n                        - Memory Protection\n                        - Shared Memory\n                        - Memory Attributes\n                3. Storage Management     (ROM) \n                     - Fragmentation\n                     - Alogo (ext4, fatfs, NTFS, jffs2, ISO9660)\n                     - metadata (Data struct about files location to access)\n                     - Storing & Organizing data\n                4. IO Management\n                     - Resond with IO Events which generated by IO devices\n                     - Interfaces with pheripherals\n                5. Network Management\n                     Manage network packets\n                     Network Interface cards",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
